---- MODULE Chart ----
\* Generated by chart-to-tla.mjs from chart.mmd.
\* Each region is one variable and each transition label is one action.
\* Once you add guards and variables from the real code, this file is the source.
\* statechart.mjs from-chart chart.mmd keeps it, checks it, and compares it with the chart.

VARIABLES main
vars == <<main>>

\* Region Main
mainStates == {"End", "Page", "Ready", "Refused"}

TypeOK ==
    /\ main \in mainStates

Init ==
    /\ main = "Ready"

\* Caller lacks partner authority or tenant differs
CallerLacksPartnerAuthorityOrTenantDiffers ==
    /\ \/ (main = "Ready" /\ main' = "Refused")

\* Search name or load actors
SearchNameOrLoadActors ==
    /\ \/ (main = "Ready" /\ main' = "Page")

\* Continue same query after last name and UUID
ContinueSameQueryAfterLastNameAndUUID ==
    /\ \/ (main = "Page" /\ main' = "Page")

\* Change query and clear cursor
ChangeQueryAndClearCursor ==
    /\ \/ (main = "Page" /\ main' = "Ready")

\* No more live matches
NoMoreLiveMatches ==
    /\ \/ (main = "Page" /\ main' = "End")

\* Invalid query or cursor or page exceeds cap
InvalidQueryOrCursorOrPageExceedsCap ==
    /\ \/ (main = "Ready" /\ main' = "Refused")

Next == CallerLacksPartnerAuthorityOrTenantDiffers \/ SearchNameOrLoadActors \/ ContinueSameQueryAfterLastNameAndUUID \/ ChangeQueryAndClearCursor \/ NoMoreLiveMatches \/ InvalidQueryOrCursorOrPageExceedsCap

Spec == Init /\ [][Next]_vars

====
